      "pinyin": "bǎ jiǔ huà sāng má",
      "cn": "端起酒杯闲谈农事家常",
      "en": "Holding wine cups, we chat about mulberry and hemp.",
      "image": "/assets/blg/poems/p70_l4.webp"
    }
